// Ultra Puck's own cards. Mods can add more files next to this one (every *.json here is read, in name order).
//   id     unique, never change it once released
//   tier   S (rarest) A B C D F (most common)
//   max    most copies one player can hold (0 = no limit)
//   art    picture in Cards/Art/<art>.jpg or .png (defaults to the id)
//   color  accent colour for the card frame
//   text   what the card face says: [good]...[/] green, [bad]...[/] red, [note]...[/] grey
//   stats  "x1.5" multiplies, "/1.6" divides, "+1" adds; "Opponent..." changes the other team instead
